---
// src/pages/journey.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout
    title="My Journey — Javier Flores | A Story of Music, Sound, and Life"
    description="More than a list of countries, this is the decade-long journey of learning through sound, constant hard work, and the world."
    lang="en"
    pathEs="viajes"
    pathEn="journey"
>
    <div class="journey-container">
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <section class="journey-hero">
            <div class="hero-inner">
                <span class="hero-badge">Logbook & Biography</span>
                <h1 class="hero-title">My 20s Across the Globe</h1>
                <p class="hero-subtitle">
                   Small reflection on how it all began and how I’ve been incredibly fortunate to travel the world doing what I love, even though the journey has taught me just how much it costs to be far away from home and family.
                </p>
                <div class="hero-stats">
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <span class="stat-number">40+</span>
                        <span class="stat-label">Countries & Regions</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <span class="stat-number">180+</span>
                        <span class="stat-label">Cities Explored</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <span class="stat-number">50+</span>
                        <span class="stat-label">Trips & Routes</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-card">
                        <span class="stat-number">2000+</span>
                        <span class="stat-label">Days on the Road</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Main Content & Timeline -->
        <div id="main">
            <section class="wrapper style1">
                <div class="inner">
                    <header class="major">
                        <h2>The Path Traveled</h2>
                        <p>Every phase: from traditional folklore festivals in Asia to the being a tech in the high-seas.</p>
                    </header>

                    <div class="timeline-container">

                        <!-- Phase 1: 2018 -->
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <span class="timeline-date">2018</span>
                                <h3>The First Big Leap: Asia</h3>
                                <p>
                                    My twenties began with a leap straight to the other side of the planet. As a performer and technical team member with the Compañía Folklórica Magisterial de Hidalgo, I arrived in <strong>Taiwan</strong> to perform at the Yilan International Folklore Festival, followed by journeys in <strong>South Korea</strong>. It was my first true cultural immersion and proof that music and sound serve as a universal language.
                                </p>
                                <div class="timeline-images">
                                    <img src={`${base}images/Javier-Flores-Taipei-Taiwan.webp`} alt="Javier Flores in Taiwan" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" />
                                    <img src={`${base}images/Javier-Flores-Yilan-Taiwan.webp`} alt="Javier Flores performing at the Yilan International Festival" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" />
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Phase 2: Late 2018 - Early 2019 -->
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <span class="timeline-date">Late 2018 - Early 2019</span>
                                <h3>Europe by Train and Backpack</h3>
                                <p>
                                    I landed in Brno, <strong>Czech Republic</strong>, to study Creative Economies Management. Those months opened the door to overland journeys across Europe on a tight budget: traveling through Prague, <strong>Slovakia</strong>, <strong>Hungary</strong>, and <strong>Poland</strong>, and later through <strong>Germany</strong>, <strong>France</strong>, <strong>Belgium</strong>, and the <strong>Netherlands</strong>. I learned to navigate independently, to listen deeply, and to absorb the architecture and culture of every place.
                                </p>
                                <div class="timeline-images">
                                    <img src={`${base}images/Javier-Flores-Casa-de-la-Musica-de-Viena.webp`} alt="Javier Flores during his time in Europe" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" />
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Phase 3: 2019 -->
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <span class="timeline-date">2019</span>
                                <h3>Tradition and History in the Middle East</h3>
                                <p>
                                    The journey led me to the <strong>United Arab Emirates</strong> for Sharjah Heritage Days. Immersing myself in such a distinct culture—walking between the traditional architecture of Sharjah and the grand scale of Dubai—proved to be a transformative experience.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Phase 4: 2022 -->
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <span class="timeline-date">2022</span>
                                <h3>Mediterranean Coasts and Atlantic Islands</h3>
                                <p>
                                    Following the global pause, I returned to the road during an intense phase of work and growth across the Mediterranean and Atlantic. I explored ports and stories in <strong>Greece</strong>, <strong>France</strong>, <strong>Norway</strong>, <strong>Ireland</strong>, <strong>Croatia</strong>, <strong>Monaco</strong>, and later island nations like <strong>Jamaica</strong> and <strong>Bermuda</strong>.
                                </p>
                                <div class="timeline-images">
                                    <img src={`${base}images/Javier-Flores-Australia.webp`} alt="Javier Flores traveling internationally" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" />
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Phase 5: 2023 -->
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <span class="timeline-date">2023</span>
                                <h3>Life at Sea: The Caribbean</h3>
                                <p>
                                    My career took a defining turn as I took on technical leadership responsibilities onboard Disney Cruise Line. Integrating and operating complex audio systems daily while sailing through <strong>Colombia</strong>, <strong>Panama</strong>, and dozens of Caribbean islands (including the <strong>Bahamas</strong>, <strong>Aruba</strong>, <strong>Curaçao</strong>, and <strong>Sint Maarten</strong>) meant long hours, high discipline, and the quiet satisfaction of making flawless shows happen every night.
                                </p>
                                <div class="timeline-images">
                                    <img src={`${base}images/Javier-Flores-Frozen.webp`} alt="Javier Flores during Disney Cruise Line theatrical productions" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" />
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Phase 6: 2025 -->
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <span class="timeline-date">2025</span>
                                <h3>Oceania and North America</h3>
                                <p>
                                    Crossing the equator into the South Pacific, I visited <strong>Australia</strong> and <strong>New Zealand</strong>, balancing the demanding pace of production with time to explore the region's natural landscapes, before continuing on to tours and work assignments across <strong>Canada</strong>.
                                </p>
                                <div class="timeline-images">
                                    <img src={`${base}images/Javier-Flores-Sydney.webp`} alt="Javier Flores in Sydney, Australia" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" />
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Phase 7: May 2026 -->
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <span class="timeline-date">May 2026</span>
                                <h3>Southern Europe and Historic Acoustics</h3>
                                <p>
                                    I returned to Europe to travel through <strong>Italy</strong>, <strong>Spain</strong>, and <strong>Portugal</strong>. Beyond personal exploration, the focus shifted toward listening: studying historical venue acoustics, architectural sound, and preparing academically for upcoming projects.
                                </p>
                                <div class="timeline-images">
                                    <img src={`${base}images/Javier-Flores-Coctel-Calavera.webp`} alt="Javier Flores touring Southern Europe" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" />
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Phase 8: Recent Months -->
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <div class="timeline-marker"></div>
                            <div class="timeline-content">
                                <span class="timeline-date">Recent Months</span>
                                <h3>Global Crossroads and Home Roots</h3>
                                <p>
                                    My recent months have maintained a brisk momentum across <strong>Puerto Rico</strong>, the <strong>United Kingdom</strong>, <strong>Denmark</strong>, and various cities in the <strong>United States</strong>. Yet no matter how many miles I travel, my anchor remains rooted in <strong>Mexico</strong> and my hometown of <strong>Atlixco, Puebla</strong>. Traveling teaches you to value hard work, but above all, it teaches you the true meaning of returning home.
                                </p>
                                <div class="timeline-images">
                                    <img src={`${base}images/Javier-Flores-Alaska.webp`} alt="Javier Flores in recent global travels" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="600" height="400" />
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </div>

                    <div class="back-action">
                        <a href={`${base}`} class="primary-btn">Return to Home</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>
    </div>

    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

        body, #wrapper {
            background-color: #0f131f !important;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;
        }

        .journey-container {
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background-color: #0f131f;
        }

        .journey-hero {
            padding: 8rem 2rem 4rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15, 19, 31, 0.95) 0%, rgba(21, 27, 43, 0.8) 100%);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.15);
        }

        .hero-inner {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .hero-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.1);
            color: #00e5ff;
            padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto 3rem auto;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .hero-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }

        .stat-card {
            background: rgba(21, 27, 43, 0.7);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            transition: transform 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease;
        }

        .stat-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            border-color: rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.4);
        }

        .stat-number {
            display: block;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #00e5ff;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .stat-label {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            font-weight: 500;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }

        /* Timeline Styles */
        .timeline-container {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 4rem auto;
            padding-left: 2rem;
        }

        .timeline-container::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 7px;
            top: 0;
            height: 100%;
            width: 3px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #00e5ff 0%, #6fc3df 50%, #8d82c4 100%);
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .timeline-item {
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
        }

        .timeline-marker {
            position: absolute;
            left: -2rem;
            top: 4px;
            width: 17px;
            height: 17px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #0f131f;
            border: 3px solid #00e5ff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.5);
        }

        .timeline-content {
            background: rgba(21, 27, 43, 0.6);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 2rem;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            transition: transform 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease;
        }

        .timeline-content:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            border-color: rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .timeline-date {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #00e5ff;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .timeline-content h3 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .timeline-content p {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .timeline-images {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
        }

        .timeline-images img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 220px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            transition: transform 0.25s ease;
        }

        .timeline-images img:hover {
            transform: scale(1.02);
        }

        .back-action {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 5rem 0 3rem 0;
        }

        .journey-container header.major {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto 3rem auto;
        }

        .journey-container header.major p {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .primary-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00e5ff, #0088cc);
            color: #0f131f !important;
            padding: 0.85rem 2.5rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.3);
            transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
        }

        .primary-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 25px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.5);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .journey-hero {
                padding: 6rem 1rem 3rem 1rem;
            }
            .timeline-container {
                padding-left: 1.5rem;
            }
            .timeline-content {
                padding: 1.25rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</Layout>